{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42374","headline":"送萧尚书致仕归庐陵 · 徐铉","name":"送萧尚书致仕归庐陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江海分飞二十春，重论前事不堪闻。\n主忧臣辱谁非我，曲突徙薪唯有君。\n金紫满身皆外物，雪霜垂领便离羣。\n鹤归华表望不尽，玉笥山头多白云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42374.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42374","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}